      "role": "dm",
      "content": "Cedar Desktop Travel Verification L4, clattering hooves and frantic bleating break into the afternoon. A fluffy white sheep with a black face and curled horns bounds toward you and the group, its wool bouncing with each stride. It has an ornate scroll clenched in its mouth.\n\nAs it reaches you, the sheep waves the scroll toward the group. Its bleating and the surprised yelps around you make the commotion hard to miss, but the scroll itself is the clearest thing it seems to be offering.\n\nThe sheep is close enough to approach, and the scroll is within reach. What do you do?",
      "event_id": 475,
      "citations": [
