    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "You take the scroll and read its ornate script aloud. The sheep’s frantic bleating shifts into cultured Common, spoken with an elven accent and a slight bleat.\n\n“Finethir Shinebright,” he says. “I’m a wizard, and I urgently need your aid. A dangerous wizard has a powerful artifact, and I need help recovering it.” He fixes his black face on you, the scroll still held out between you.\n\nHis plea hangs amid the fading clatter and surprised yelps. What do you say or do?",
      "event_id": 478,
