    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "You remain beside Finethir as the approaching commotion swells into howling, angry shouts, and occasional screams. Guz shoves through the crowd, three large wolves at his side, their iron collars clanking as they move. Their eyes seem strangely intelligent. Behind him looms a hulking figure in a dirty brown cloak.\n\nFinethir’s black face turns toward the newcomers; his curled horns and white fleece stand out against the jostling crowd. The scroll’s plea for help is still fresh between you, while Guz and his wolves close in. What do you do?",
      "event_id": 481,
      "citations": [
